{
  "uid": "oke-lab",
  "title": "OKE Lab — Traffic & Scaling",
  "description": "Istio request telemetry from the lab Prometheus. Proxy count visualizes scaling, not HPA desired replicas or readiness.",
  "tags": [
    "oke",
    "istio",
    "bootcamp"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "editable": false,
  "refresh": "15s",
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": ["5s", "15s", "30s", "1m", "5m"]
  },
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "How to read this lab dashboard",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Namespace:** `oke-lab` · **Application:** `hello-oke` · **Refresh:** 15 seconds\n\nRun the bounded `/work` load generator to see traffic and proxy count rise. **Proxy count is not HPA desired replicas or readiness**; use `kubectl -n oke-lab get hpa` for HPA CPU and replica status. The HPA uses Metrics Server, not Prometheus. Empty latency/success panels can mean no traffic; do not interpret missing data as healthy."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Requests / second",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Destination-reported inbound requests, averaged over one minute.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "oke-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(istio_requests_total{reporter=\"destination\",destination_workload_namespace=\"oke-lab\",destination_workload=\"hello-oke\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "noValue": "No data",
          "mappings": [{"type": "special", "options": {"match": "nan", "result": {"text": "No data"}}}],
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "last"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Successful requests",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "HTTP 2xx and 3xx as a percentage of destination-reported requests. No traffic yields no data.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "oke-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(istio_requests_total{reporter=\"destination\",destination_workload_namespace=\"oke-lab\",destination_workload=\"hello-oke\",response_code=~\"2..|3..\"}[1m])) / sum(rate(istio_requests_total{reporter=\"destination\",destination_workload_namespace=\"oke-lab\",destination_workload=\"hello-oke\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "noValue": "No data",
          "mappings": [{"type": "special", "options": {"match": "nan", "result": {"text": "No data"}}}],
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "last"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Application proxies up",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Successfully scraped application proxies; excludes the traffic generator. Discovery and termination can lag actual replicas.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "oke-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count(up{job=\"istio-workloads\",namespace=\"oke-lab\",pod=~\"hello-oke-[a-f0-9]+-.*\"} == 1)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "No data",
          "mappings": [{"type": "special", "options": {"match": "nan", "result": {"text": "No data"}}}],
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "last"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Istiod scrape health",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "1 means the Istiod metrics endpoint is successfully scraped; 0 means scrape failure. This alone is not full control-plane health.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "oke-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "min(up{job=\"istiod\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "No data",
          "mappings": [{"type": "special", "options": {"match": "nan", "result": {"text": "No data"}}}],
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "last"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Traffic through Istio",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Destination-reported inbound traffic for hello-oke.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "oke-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(istio_requests_total{reporter=\"destination\",destination_workload_namespace=\"oke-lab\",destination_workload=\"hello-oke\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "Requests / second",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Application proxy count — scaling indicator",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Compare baseline, scale-out, and return to two pods. Six is the HPA maximum, not a required peak. This counts successful proxy scrapes, not HPA current/desired replicas or readiness.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "oke-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count(up{job=\"istio-workloads\",namespace=\"oke-lab\",pod=~\"hello-oke-[a-f0-9]+-.*\"} == 1)",
          "legendFormat": "Application proxies",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Request latency",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Istio destination latency distribution. CPU-intensive /work requests are slower than baseline /.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "oke-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(istio_request_duration_milliseconds_bucket{reporter=\"destination\",destination_workload_namespace=\"oke-lab\",destination_workload=\"hello-oke\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(istio_request_duration_milliseconds_bucket{reporter=\"destination\",destination_workload_namespace=\"oke-lab\",destination_workload=\"hello-oke\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Response codes",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Includes HTTP 429 when bounded application concurrency is exceeded and 5xx if observed.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "oke-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (response_code) (rate(istio_requests_total{reporter=\"destination\",destination_workload_namespace=\"oke-lab\",destination_workload=\"hello-oke\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "HTTP {{response_code}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
